:: StoryCaption [nobr]
<<if $flags.candle_lit>>
<div @class="'candle ' + ($wax lte 10 ? 'low' : $wax lte 25 ? 'short' : '')">
	<div class="wax" @style="'width:' + $wax + '%'"></div>
</div>
<div class="candle-text"><<if $wax lte 10>>The flame is almost gone.<<elseif $wax lte 25>>Your candle is short now. The flame shakes.<<elseif $wax lte 50>>Half your candle is gone.<<else>>Your candle burns bright.<</if>></div>
<</if>>
<div class="satchel">
	<b>Satchel</b> ($satchel.length/6)
	<<if $satchel.length is 0>><div>Empty.</div><<else>><<for _item range $satchel>><div><<= _item.replace(/_/g, " ")>></div><</for>><</if>>
</div>
<<if Story.has("DebugPanel")>><<include "DebugPanel">><</if>>

:: StoryMenu
<<link "Journal">><<run Dialog.create("Journal"); Dialog.wikiPassage("Journal"); Dialog.open()>><</link>>

:: Journal [ui]
<<if $answers.length is 0>>The book has not spoken yet.<<else>><<for _id range $answers>><div class="speaks"><<include `"BS_" + _id`>></div><</for>><</if>>

:: BS_dark [answer]
''Why do we fear the dark?''
//Not because of what is in it. Because of what is not: our eyes, our maps, our names for things. The dark is only the place where we stop knowing. Carry a small light, and it becomes a room.//

:: BS_dreams [answer]
''Why do we dream?''
//In the day, you live one life. At night, the mind tries all the others. A dream is a door you leave open, so the possible can visit.//

:: BS_time [answer]
''What is time?''
//Time is not a river. It is a candle. It does not pass you by. It burns, and it burns for you, and what you light with it is yours.//

:: BS_free [answer]
''What is freedom?''
//A free person is not someone with no chains. It is someone who can change their mind. Being right is a small, warm room. Many people die in it.//

:: BS_love [answer]
''What is love?''
//Love is not a feeling. A feeling comes and goes like weather. Love is a choice you make again every morning. It is choosing someone's good over your own comfort. This is the oldest law of the world. Everything else is built on it.//
